the model has p*(p+3)/2 parmaeters with p variables, which means you'll 
have 1890 variables if they are all continuous...

>  
> O : no problem
> 1: mild problem
> 2: moderate problem
> 3: severe problem
> 4: complet problem
> 9: not covered (I won't set it to missing !!)
> (.) = missing...
